From 6a14d730bbf0b85d5cfa78ca382a3c596ec48a3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 04:31:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] SoftWait no longer delays a complete 4-human room
 (v12-softfull)

Same-flag (veteran / win-rate) 4-human rooms are still preferred. If none
is possible, a mixed 4 starts immediately instead of waiting
SoftAttributeWaitSeconds (default 15). SoftWait still keeps different
flags apart for short-handed rooms.

Tested 2026-11-15 03:13 PT: a Teamplay duo + 2 solos, same Mix key,
different veteran flags, used to wait ~14-16 s after the 4th joined;
they now match at once. 5 new tests (150 total).

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
